STEP 9: Model endpoint stopped: agents report provider_error and fall back to explore
Stop the model endpoint now so every ask returns provider_error.
A local endpoint: stop its server. A hosted one: disconnect the network or set a bad key.
Neuron's README does not document a switch for this, so it is done by hand and recorded in docs/VERIFIED.md.
